  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communications and Visibility of the European Union in the Kyrgyz Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The global objective is to contribute to enhance the visibility of the EU in the Kyrgyz Republic by communicating effectively on what the EU is (i.e. its core values) and what the EU is doing through its political dialogue and cooperation programmes.In particular, it is of utmost importance to ensure that the solidarity and efforts made further to the COVID-19 crisis and the October political crisis is made visible to the people.</narrative>
  </description>
